<template><view class="page"><view class="tip">近100条血糖记录。当前 V1 用列表和相对刻度展示，后续可接 ECharts 做日/周/月统计。</view><view v-for="i in list" :key="i.id" class="card"><view class="top"><b>{{i.numericValue}} {{i.unit||'mmol/L'}}</b><text :class="i.riskLevel==='HIGH'?'danger':''">{{i.riskLevelText||i.riskLevel}}</text></view><view class="bar"><view :style="{width:width(i.numericValue)}"></view></view><view class="time">{{i.measuredAt}} · {{i.periodCode||'未标记时段'}}</view></view><view v-if="!list.length" class="empty">暂无血糖记录</view></view></template><script>import{getHealthDataList}from'@/api/health.js';export default{data(){return{list:[]}},onShow(){getHealthDataList({dataType:'GLUCOSE',page:1,limit:100}).then(r=>{const d=r&&r.data?r.data:r;this.list=(d&&d.list)||d||[]})},methods:{width(v){const n=Math.max(0,Math.min(20,Number(v)||0));return(n/20*100)+'%'}}}</script><style lang="scss" scoped>.page{min-height:100vh;background:#f6f7f8;padding:24rpx}.tip,.card{background:#fff;border-radius:20rpx;padding:24rpx;margin-bottom:16rpx}.tip{color:#777;font-size:24rpx}.top{display:flex;justify-content:space-between}.top b{font-size:34rpx}.bar{height:14rpx;background:#edf1f0;border-radius:99rpx;margin:20rpx 0;overflow:hidden}.bar view{height:100%;background:#19bf9b}.time{color:#999;font-size:23rpx}.danger{color:#e44}.empty{text-align:center;padding:100rpx;color:#aaa}</style>